          ],
          "content": "？ Using similar reasoning find out the decimal numbers in the boxes below."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.145,
            0.407,
            0.185
          ],
          "content": "Which is larger: 6.456 or 6.465?"
