        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.196,
            0.407,
            0.288
          ],
          "content": "To answer this, we can use the number line to locate both decimal numbers and show which is larger."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.288,
            0.407,
            0.38
          ],
          "content": "This can also be done by comparing the corresponding digits at each place value, as we do with whole numbers."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.424,
            0.261,
            0.852,
            0.375
          ],
